1. UPSTREAM NOTICE
   The original "Zygisk Next" (also "ZygiskSU") module is the work of
   its upstream authors (5ec1cff, Nullptr, aviraxp). The upstream
   README explicitly prohibits modification, redistribution, and
   extraction of components. The compiled binaries under
   prebuilt/<abi>/ in this repository are byte-identical
   reconstructions of the upstream binaries, included here solely for
   build verification and personal study.

2. SOURCE CODE STATUS
   The C/C++/Vue/TypeScript source files under native/, webui/, blobs/,
   and scripts/ are a fresh reimplementation written from publicly
   available information (public Zygisk API, ELF symbol tables, the
   module's bootstrap description). They have not been compiled and
   tested. They are NOT a working drop-in replacement for upstream
   Zygisk Next. They are committed here as a personal reference.

